"update": 1,
"values": ["But that's not really how it went... is it?", "", "Did you think you were being clever?", "After everything we've done to you.", "After all the times we've put you in a bind.", "You always came back.", "Even your red friend tried to warn you.", "If you’ve survived this long, it’s only by luck.", "Everything you’re experiencing right now
is nothing but an illusion.", "Created by your stupid brain because you
refuse to accept that you’ve lost.", "...", "In reality, you’re here...", "standing in front of me, crying, asking for help.", "...", "But it’s too late now…", "And besides, you were really a disappointment.", "I thought you were stronger...", "than this.", "...", "I guess it’s time to say goodbye.", "I don’t have time to waste on you.", "...", "...", "Rest in peace...", "Amy Rose."]
}
